.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2694609037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103427#issuecomment-2694609037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103427","id":2694609037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gnHiN","user":{"login":"cosmoddd","id":9627628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2Mjc2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9627628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd","html_url":"https://github.com/cosmoddd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosmoddd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T14:35:15Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T14:47:18Z","body":"In my use case, there is no keyboard to press Enter on.  I'm trying to edit a line of text remotely by using a controller only.  This requires that I leave the focus of the line edit and interact with other UI elements (Buttons, primarily) to feed in specific string combinations to LineEdit.  \n\nThe functionality of `carat_force_displayed` becomes essential in this situation.  When it was working, I could see where the letters would appear on the LineEdit node without having to refocus on the LineEdit to see the caret.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2694609037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laug